#N canvas 100 100 620 380 12;
#X text 20 10 fallingstar_source <name>: fallingstar as a spatialized source in a slot (opened by whistle-spawn or the game). Values come on <name>-whistle-source: alive 1 starts the stars \, distance <tiles> \, pos \, range \, width \, curve. To end it from here: [alive 0( -> [list prepend \$1] -> [s whistle-source] (always a list with the name first).;
#X obj 20 140 r \$1-whistle-source;
#X obj 20 170 route alive;
#X obj 20 210 fallingstar;
#X obj 20 250 *~ 0.4;
#X obj 120 250 *~ 0.4;
#X obj 20 290 outlet~;
#X obj 120 290 outlet~;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 3 1 5 0;
#X connect 4 0 6 0;
#X connect 5 0 7 0;
